Fri Oct  2 10:17:47 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 1.3
  * Change duplicate keybind.
  * Add support for slower V8 initialization without the snapshot.
  * Add path pre-verification before saving.
  * Add invert scroll option.
  * Fix for ui::Splitter Widget bug. #593
  * Fix font alignment for the 'Add Text' tool. #626
  * reduce 'unknown windowevent' stdout spam. #625
  * Fix the first-run UI scale to be estimated based on the real
    screen size.
  * Extend the symmetry commands options. #644
  * Allow removing hidden layers. #643
  * Fix sprite height reported by crash recovery. #649
  * Sort file type dropdown alphabetically. #653
  * Add keyboard shortcut to toggle Tiled Mode. #652
  * Increase max brush size limit to 256px #651
  * Allow typing/pasting a path in the file selector's location bar
  * Flatten layer groups when loading .ase files.
  * Backport bugfixes from Besprited clang-tidy cleanup pass.
  * Fix security issues: zip-slip, shell injection, codec memory
    safety, script sandbox escapes. #668
- Update to version 1.2
  Scripting
  * More scripting API functions
  * More example scripts
  * Voxel.js: Render your sprite's layers as a 3D object and export
    an STL.
  Translation
  * LibreSprite's UI now has preliminary (machine) translations for
    the following languages: English, Chinese, French, German,
    Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese, Spanish, Hindi,
    Indonesian, Russian.
  * Currently there is no support for right-to-left languages.
  * The UI now uses a TTF font in order to render all of the special
    characters legibly. If text looks blurry to you, make sure you
    set the Screen Scaling to 1.
  Pen Pressure
  * Support has been implemented on Windows, MacOS, Linux with
    Xinput, Android and Emscripten.
  Bug Fixes
  * Fixed the community quilt being way too big in the home screen.
  * The Linux build should now run on non-glibc distros.

